      "fact_text": {
        "text": "For each question, we want to validate the value that the user enters and keep asking the same question until the user enters a valid value.",
        "refs": ["Q0010", "Q0013", "Q0014", "Q0016", "Q0017", "Q0018"],
        "claims": [
          {
            "text": "Validate user input in a loop and repeat the prompt until a valid value is entered.",
            "basis": "explicit",
            "availability": "SOURCE_SUPPORTED",
            "literal_kind": "verbal",
            "instructional_role": "prerequisite",
            "refs": ["Q0010", "Q0013", "Q0014", "Q0016", "Q0017", "Q0018"],
            "related_refs": []
          }
        ]
      },
      "fact_type": null
    },
    {
      "fact_text": {
        "text": "An infinite loop (while true) can be used to repeatedly ask the same question until a valid input is received.",
        "refs": ["Q0012", "Q0019"],
        "claims": [
          {
            "text": "Use an infinite while‑true loop to repeatedly prompt for input until validation succeeds.",
            "basis": "explicit",
            "availability": "SOURCE_SUPPORTED",
            "literal_kind": "verbal",
            "instructional_role": "prerequisite",
            "refs": ["Q0012", "Q0019"],
            "related_refs": []
          }
        ]
      },
      "fact_type": null
    },
    {
      "fact_text": {
        "text": "When validating the principal amount, the valid range is between 1,000 and 1,000,000 (underscores may be used for readability).",
        "refs": ["Q0015", "Q0018"],
        "claims": [
          {
            "text": "Principal must be >= 1000 and <= 1_000_000; underscores are allowed in numeric literals for readability.",
            "basis": "explicit",
            "availability": "SOURCE_SUPPORTED",
            "literal_kind": "verbal",
            "instructional_role": "prerequisite",
            "refs": ["Q0015", "Q0018"],
            "related_refs": []
          }
        ]
      },
      "fact_type": null
    },
    {
      "fact_text": {
        "text": "A variable declared inside a loop block is scoped to that block and is not available outside of it, causing a compilation error if referenced later.",
        "refs": ["Q0024", "Q0025", "Q0026", "Q0027"],
        "claims": [
          {
            "text": "Variables declared inside a loop are block‑scoped and cannot be accessed outside the loop.",
            "basis": "explicit",
            "availability": "SOURCE_SUPPORTED",
            "literal_kind": "verbal",
            "instructional_role": "explanation_of_mistake",
            "refs": ["Q0024", "Q0025", "Q0026", "Q0027"],
            "related_refs": []
          }
        ]
      },
      "fact_type": null
    },
    {
      "fact_text": {
        "text": "To fix the compilation error, declare the variable (e.g., int principal) outside the loop, optionally initializing it to zero.",
        "refs": ["Q0028", "Q0029", "Q0030", "Q0031"],
        "claims": [
          {
            "text": "Declare variables needed across iterations outside the loop (e.g., int principal = 0) to avoid scope errors.",
            "basis": "explicit",
            "availability": "SOURCE_SUPPORTED",
            "literal_kind": "verbal",
            "instructional_role": "corrected_approach",
            "refs": ["Q0028", "Q0029", "Q0030", "Q0031"],
            "related_refs": []
          }
        ]
      },
      "fact_type": null
    },
    {
      "fact_text": {
        "text": "The same validation pattern with an infinite loop should be repeated for other inputs such as annual interest rate.",
        "refs": ["Q0032", "Q0033", "Q0034", "Q0035"],
        "claims": [
          {
            "text": "Apply the same input‑validation‑in‑loop pattern to each subsequent question (e.g., annual interest).",
            "basis": "explicit",
            "availability": "SOURCE_SUPPORTED",
            "literal_kind": "verbal",
            "instructional_role": "continuation",
            "refs": ["Q0032", "Q0033", "Q0034", "Q0035"],
            "related_refs": []
          }
        ]
      },
      "fact_type": null
    }
  ],
